<h2>The Master's Materials on Which This Book Relies</h2>
<p>Edited transcripts of the sessions (faith in the Unseen; sessions two, three, four, nine, twelve, thirteen), "Qur'anic Beliefs", "Self-Esteem and the Feeling of Worthiness", "Meanings of Words", "Having a Wish", "Goal", the "Daily Practice" slides, the Q&amp;A of session twelve, the diagram "The Cycle of Realization", the electromagnetic-spectrum image, and the two voice-message explanations to the AI.</p></div></body></html>